{"unit_id":"6269f49c22c783ecfcfd","title":"七、案由： 研議高脂血症病人經治療符合目標值後，是否停止持續以降","kind":"proposal","blocks":[{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-2ddb470e030dddb29547-p3-b22","raw_text":"七、案由： 研議高脂血症病人經治療符合目標值後，是否停止持續以降\n","start_char":0,"end_char":33,"bbox":[84.98400115966797,635.9638061523438,519.802734375,651.618408203125]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-2ddb470e030dddb29547-p3-b23","raw_text":"血脂藥物治療案。（提案單位：秘書處） \n","start_char":0,"end_char":20,"bbox":[155.89999389648438,661.4539184570312,414.8499755859375,675.493896484375]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-2ddb470e030dddb29547-p3-b24","raw_text":"結論： \n","start_char":0,"end_char":5,"bbox":[112.94000244140625,685.4539184570312,161.9600067138672,699.493896484375]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-2ddb470e030dddb29547-p3-b25","raw_text":"(一) 高血壓或糖尿病患者以降血壓或糖尿病藥物達目標值後，不\n","start_char":0,"end_char":31,"bbox":[124.94000244140625,707.9937744140625,524.3098754882812,723.6483764648438]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-2ddb470e030dddb29547-p3-b26","raw_text":"應據此要求減量藥物；高血脂與高血壓、糖尿病相同，應持\n","start_char":0,"end_char":27,"bbox":[155.89999389648438,733.449951171875,524.3098754882812,747.4899291992188]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-2ddb470e030dddb29547-p3-b27","raw_text":"續給予藥物治療。如果有需要減量的理由，應尊重醫師臨床\n","start_char":0,"end_char":27,"bbox":[155.89999389648438,757.449951171875,524.3098754882812,771.4899291992188]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-2ddb470e030dddb29547-p4-b1","raw_text":"裁量。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":5,"bbox":[155.89999389648438,73.11394500732422,204.9499969482422,87.15394592285156]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-2ddb470e030dddb29547-p4-b2","raw_text":"(二) 通過增訂西醫基層醫療費用審查注意事項審查注意事項-內\n","start_char":0,"end_char":31,"bbox":[124.94000244140625,95.6738052368164,524.6199951171875,111.32840728759766]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-2ddb470e030dddb29547-p4-b3","raw_text":"科降血脂藥物相關規範如附件七，病人經藥物治療符合目標\n","start_char":0,"end_char":27,"bbox":[155.89999389648438,121.13396453857422,524.3098754882812,135.17396545410156]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-2ddb470e030dddb29547-p4-b4","raw_text":"值後，得持續藥物治療；是否維持原劑量或減輕劑量，應尊\n","start_char":0,"end_char":27,"bbox":[155.89999389648438,145.13397216796875,524.3098754882812,159.17396545410156]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-2ddb470e030dddb29547-p4-b5","raw_text":"重臨床醫師意見。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":10,"bbox":[155.89999389648438,169.13397216796875,275.0299987792969,183.17396545410156]}],"source_quality":[]}